WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:07.048
Can I bring my friend?

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:11.261
I have no idea where your clothes are.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:16.224
This foreigner says that
he can't find his clothes.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:19.352
-Do you know anything about it?
-No.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:23.982
All I did, was ask if I can
bring a friend along.

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:26.067
But they seem to be flustered.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:30.572
Are they worried because they don't
want us to copy their style of bathhouses?

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:31.364
This sure is a problem.

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:33.033
This sure is a problem.

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:37.287
I just replaced my husband at this post,
so I have no idea.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:40.331
My husband went to play the slot machines.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.001
It's too bad…

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:46.212
I understand that these flat-faced people

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:49.549
cherish their bathing culture.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:54.596
But now that they're
part of the Roman Empire,

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:57.724
they must understand that the Romans

00:00:57.807 --> 00:01:01.227
have the right to take in their culture.

